# Phase 3 PR 3 (#624). Cull cycle wired into the auto-promote sidecar
# under RESEARCH_CULL_ENABLED=1; reads the same --preview output as the
# dashboard does and shares the colony-fitness.py join.
#
# Phase 9 PR-B (#663) renamed the explorer-only tool to cull-replicas.sh
# and added a positional <colony_name> argument. The legacy
# cull-explorers.sh wrapper forwards to cull-replicas.sh with
# colony=explorer for back-compat. Both are bundled. The new
# colony-fitness.py / explorer-fitness.py shim pair replaces the old
# explorer-fitness.py.
tools/cull-explorers.sh
tools/cull-replicas.sh
tools/colony-fitness.py
tools/explorer-fitness.py
